# ironsight: Synty-derived GLBs are unversioned — the Synty EULA forbids sharing
# source files outside the team (shipping them inside the deployed worker is fine).
# Canonical private copy: D:\game-assets\ironsight-synty-derived (see apps/ironsight/public/assets/README.md)
